Do you have a graphics head on the AS800, or are you using a serial 
terminal?  What is the value of the "console" variable in the SRM:

        >>> show console

It should match your console ("graphics" means console is on the graphics, 
"serial" means console is on the serial console).  If not, then:

        >>> set console graphics or serial

as appropriate, then:
        
        >>> init

Now, after booting, are there any messages between the boot command and the 
return to the >>> prompt?  If so, post them.

-- 

        Stu


